   "data": {
    "filepath": "",
    "lang": "None",
    "width": 19,
    "etext": "Cardinal Web test build 0\n\nThis patch plays by itself.\n\nSEQ 3 (left) is the sequencer: its RUN button starts and stops it.\nRow 1 knobs are the arpeggio notes (1 V per octave).\nTEMPO sets the speed.\n\nSEQ 3 CV1 -> VCO pitch\nSEQ 3 TRIG -> ADSR gate\nVCO SAW -> VCA in\nADSR env -> VCA CV\nVCA out -> Audio 2 (both channels)\n\nLong-press a module for its menu.\n"
   }
  }
